>Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Fair<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Fair<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shiny%20Blade\"><img alt=\"Shiny Blade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shiny_Blade_6863ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystalline%20Axe\"><img alt=\"Crystalline Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystalline_Axe_75fc76.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Decorative%20Ribbon\"><img alt=\"Decorative Ribbon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Decorative_Ribbon_cc329b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mycological%20Mace\"><img alt=\"Mycological Mace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mycological_Mace_b40eaa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mycological%20Bow\"><img alt=\"Mycological Bow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mycological_Bow_74eaa4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/>July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Through one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Crystal%20Teleporter\">Crystal Teleporters</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a>, you need at least 1440 mission points and a special <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Teleport%20Crystal\">Red Teleport Crystal</a> in order to enter. You must also have completed <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%201\">Warzone 1</a> at least once.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hints\">Hints</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Red Pieces of Cloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Everblazing\">Wand of Everblazing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Crossbow\">Crystal Crossbow</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other items will drop but these are of most interest.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Weeper\">Weepers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Infected%20Weeper\">Infected Weepers</a> are a mage's demise. These monsters will constantly retarget to the lowest level mage in the area. Knights and paladins should block their paths so they cannot reach the mages; usually this will involve standing in front of the weeper. The mage targeted should remain calm because blocking weepers is impossible if the mage target is moving.</li>\n<li>Monsters come in large groups and most are fire-based. Bring fire-resistant gear and <a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche%20Rune\">Avalanche Runes</a> (mages).</li>\n<li>Energy fields work wonders here as nothing crosses them. Consider bringing <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb%20Rune\">Energy Bomb Runes</a> to trap <a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawlers</a>, this will prevent them from moving so you can easily avoid their beam.</li>\n<li>Everything except <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a> has lethal beams. Avoid standing in beams as much as possible.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawlers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lava%20Golem\">Lava Golems</a> cause severe <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulfire\">Soulfire</a> effects. You may want to ask a <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a> priest for help when you leave the warzone.</li>\n<li>Prepare for severe manadrain: <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lava%20Golem\">Lava Golem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawler</a>.</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Quest\">Quest</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Gnomevil is undoubtedly the easiest warzone boss. If you have a team capable of killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Deathstrike\">Deathstrike</a>, you could probably split your team and kill <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomevil\">Gnomevil</a> twice.</li>\n<li>To enter Gnomevil's room you need to break the barrier at the end of the warzone. This involves luring an <a href=\"#/wiki/Infected%20Weeper\">Infected Weeper</a> to the bars and killing its <a href=\"#/wiki/Parasite\">Parasite</a> summons when it is next to the barrier. <a href=\"#/wiki/Infected%20Weeper\">Infected Weepers</a> can be found in the north-eastern room (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33080,31931,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33080, 31931, 11)</a>); any other weeper spawns are too far to be lured.</li>\n<li>While luring an infected weeper, the infected weeper will try to look for a low level mage. Ideally, the low level mage would stand by the bars to lure the weeper.</li>\n<li>When the weeper is at the bars, block him in by shooting <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wall%20Rune\">Energy Wall Runes</a> west of him. Also, shoot a wall rune to the east of the bars, as the weeper can summon behind them. Now wait for the weeper to summon <a href=\"#/wiki/Parasite\">Parasites</a>. 3 parasites are needed to open the wall, but if a long time passes before another parasite is killed, the wall may regenerate a stage.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward_Chest\">Reward Chest</span></h3>\n<p>You will always get 5 out of the 9 items available, but you can never get more than one piece of a statue at the same time and chances to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\">Miniature House</a> are very slim.\n</p>\n<ul class=\"item-tile-list\"><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Major%20Crystalline%20Token\"><img alt=\"Major Crystalline Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Major_Crystalline_Token_acc0d8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">2x <a href=\"#/wiki/Major%20Crystalline%20Token\">Major Crystalline Token</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\"><img alt=\"Blue Crystal Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Crystal_Shard_a41aa3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">10x <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\">Blue Crystal Shard</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Prismatic%20Necklace\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Prismatic_Necklace_749ad2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Prismatic%20Necklace\">Prismatic Necklace</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">4x <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mucus%20Plug\"><img alt=\"Mucus Plug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mucus_Plug_1d3cd6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mucus%20Plug\">Mucus Plug</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Head%20of%20Gnomevil\"><img alt=\"Head of Gnomevil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Head_of_Gnomevil_4d595d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Head%20of%20Gnomevil\">Head of Gnomevil</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Torso%20of%20Gnomevil\"><img alt=\"Torso of Gnomevil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Torso_of_Gnomevil_ee7078.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Torso%20of%20Gnomevil\">Torso of Gnomevil</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Legs%20of%20Gnomevil\"><img alt=\"Legs of Gnomevil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Legs_of_Gnomevil_fedb60.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Legs%20of%20Gnomevil\">Legs of Gnomevil</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\"><img alt=\"Miniature House\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Miniature_House_df3b73.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\">Miniature House</a></div></div></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Listed in order of frequency:</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loo